---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="National Treasure Nagino Castle｜Nishikino｜WORKS"
  description="Nagino Castle is an original Japanese-style castle created in Minecraft Java Edition, built as the centerpiece of the fictional town of Tekka."
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/naginocastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/nagino-2.png"
      alt="Nagino Castle"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NAGINO CASTLE
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          国宝凪ノ城
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          A vast island serving as the key to the Eastern Army's advance.
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        About the Work
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Nagino Castle is an original Japanese-style castle created in Minecraft Java Edition.<br>
        Built at the heart of the Japanese-style town of Tekka on the Wave Server,
        a Minecraft building RPG server, it stands as a large-scale landmark symbolizing the town.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          The Story of Nagino Castle
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          Nagino Castle is an original Japanese-style castle created in Minecraft Java Edition.

          It was commissioned as a landmark at the center of Tekka, a Japanese-style town on the Wave Server, after I was entrusted with managing the area.

          <br><br>

          The castle was built on a newly reclaimed island created from the remains of an older Japanese-style town that had once been destroyed by a great calamity.

          The entire island was developed as a fortified castle complex in the form of a sōgamae-style enclosure, with Nagino Castle serving as its central stronghold.

          According to the fictional history of the castle, it was constructed under the orders of the Shogun as a military base intended to bring down the samurai forces in the west and accelerate the advance of the Eastern Army.

          <br><br>

          The castle takes the form of a hirayamajiro, or castle built on a hill surrounded by relatively gentle terrain.

          Its Main Tower is an independent, multi-tiered tower, reaching a monumental scale only about two meters shorter than the former Edo Castle Main Tower.

          <br><br>

          The exterior walls are finished with wood siding characteristic of Sengoku-period castles, accented with red, gold, and natural wood tones, while predominantly dark roof tiles give the complex a solid and imposing appearance.

          <br><br>

          The design also incorporates fantastical and solemn details unique to this fictional castle, including a vividly blue main ridge and a Seiryu, or Azure Dragon, ornament whose dragon head occupies the position where a traditional shachihoko roof ornament would normally stand.

          <br><br>

          Inspired by the imposing presence of early-modern castles such as Osaka Castle and Nagoya Castle, I combined newly designed towers, gates, and stone walls with architectural motifs inherited from the former Main Tower to create a distinct visual identity and world.

          <br><br>

          A timelapse video of the original Main Tower, completed during the early stage of the project, was published on YouTube Shorts under the title “I Built a National Treasure-Level Castle in Minecraft.”

          The video received a major response, surpassing 800,000 views.

          <br><br>

          As the scale of the castle complex was later expanded, the entire design underwent a comprehensive redesign, resulting in the construction of a more magnificent “Second Main Tower.”

          <br><br>

          Although its appearance has evolved considerably from the original Main Tower, Nagino Castle continues to quietly watch over the growth of Tekka, the Japanese-style town it was built to represent.

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Title</p>
              <p class="text-base">Nagino Castle</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Classification</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese-style Castle</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Construction Period</p>
              <p class="text-base">May–June 2025</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Location</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Honmaru 1-chome 1-ban, Nagino Town, New Japanese-style Town Tekka, Wave Server
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Year of Construction</p>
              <p class="text-base">Keicho 5 (1600)</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Builder</p>
              <p class="text-base">Nishikino</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">Hirayamajiro</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Software</p>
              <p class="text-base">Minecraft: Java Edition v1.21.4</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Category</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese-style Architecture・Original Creation</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Status</p>
              <p class="text-base">Completed</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Gallery
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-2.png"
            alt="Nagino Castle"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-0.png"
            alt="Nagino Castle"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino.jpg"
            alt="Nagino Castle"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-3.png"
            alt="Nagino Castle"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>



    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/en/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← Back to Works
      </a>


      <a
        href="/en/edocastle/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        Next →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7Zi19slunLM"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        Watch More Videos →
      </a>

    </div>


       <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          Share This Work
        </h2>


        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <!-- X -->

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>


          <!-- Instagram -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>


          <!-- Copy -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Copy URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </section>

  <script>

    const sharePhrases = [
      "Found this.",
      "I kind of like this.",
      "Look at this.",
      "Found something interesting.",
      "Found something like this.",
      "Have you seen this?",
      "Found something.",
      "Came across this.",
      "Found something worth checking out."
    ];


    const pageUrl =
      "https://www.nishikinolab.net/en/naginocastle/";


    const randomPhrase =
      sharePhrases[
        Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)
      ];


    const shareText =
      `${randomPhrase} Minecraft NAGINO CASTLE | WORKS`;


    const xShareButton =
      document.getElementById("x-share");


    if (xShareButton) {

      xShareButton.setAttribute(
        "href",
        `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
      );

    }


    const copyButton =
      document.getElementById("copy-url");


    const instagramButton =
      document.getElementById("instagram-share");



    copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {

        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

        if (copyButton) {

          copyButton.textContent = "Copied";

          setTimeout(() => {

            copyButton.textContent = "Copy URL";

          }, 2000);

        }

      } catch (error) {

        console.error(error);

      }

    });


    instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

      const dialog =
        document.createElement("div");


      dialog.innerHTML = `

        <div
          id="instagram-share-overlay"
          style="
            position:fixed;
            inset:0;
            z-index:9999;
            display:flex;
            align-items:center;
            justify-content:center;
            padding:24px;
            background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
            backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
          "
        >

          <div
            style="
              width:100%;
              max-width:420px;
              padding:36px;
              border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
              border-radius:28px;
              background:#fffdfa;
              box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
              text-align:center;
            "
          >

            <p
              style="
                margin:0;
                font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                letter-spacing:.35em;
                color:#a58c65;
              "
            >
              SHARE
            </p>


            <h3
              style="
                margin:14px 0 0;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:24px;
                color:#2b2724;
                font-weight:400;
              "
            >
              Share on Instagram
            </h3>


            <p
              style="
                margin:20px 0 0;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                line-height:2;
                color:#625a52;
              "
            >
              The URL of this work page will be copied<br>
              before opening Instagram.
            </p>


            <button
              id="instagram-open"
              type="button"
              style="
                width:100%;
                margin-top:28px;
                padding:14px 20px;
                border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
                border-radius:999px;
                background:#2b2724;
                color:#fff;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:15px;
                cursor:pointer;
              "
            >
              Copy URL & Open Instagram
            </button>


            <button
              id="instagram-cancel"
              type="button"
              style="
                width:100%;
                margin-top:10px;
                padding:12px 20px;
                border:0;
                background:transparent;
                color:#8c8378;
                font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
                font-size:14px;
                cursor:pointer;
              "
            >
              Cancel
            </button>

          </div>

        </div>

      `;


      document.body.appendChild(dialog);


      const overlay =
        document.getElementById(
          "instagram-share-overlay"
        );


      const openButton =
        document.getElementById(
          "instagram-open"
        );


      const cancelButton =
        document.getElementById(
          "instagram-cancel"
        );


      openButton?.addEventListener(
        "click",
        async () => {

          try {

            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
              pageUrl
            );

          } catch (error) {

            console.error(error);

          }


          window.open(
            "https://www.instagram.com/",
            "_blank",
            "noopener,noreferrer"
          );


          overlay?.remove();

        }
      );


      cancelButton?.addEventListener(
        "click",
        () => {

          overlay?.remove();

        }
      );


      overlay?.addEventListener(
        "click",
        (event) => {

          if (event.target === overlay) {

            overlay.remove();

          }

        }
      );

    });

  </script>



<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}




.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }

}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }


  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>